Package: proxmaid
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Proxmaid <support@proxmaid.dev>
Description: Proxmaid Storage Management for Proxmox
 Proxmaid is a storage management sidecar for Proxmox VE
 that wraps the NonRAID kernel driver. It provides a REST
 API and web UI for managing arrays, disks, shares, Docker
 apps, and notifications.
Depends: mergerfs, smartmontools
Recommends: samba, nfs-kernel-server, docker.io
